<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten feed prices mixed, meal steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten feed prices mixed, meal steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed pellet prices were mixed on Monday in fairly active trade as dealers tried to catch up between holidays last week and this week, cash sources said. Meal prices were quietly steady.</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today     Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -  unq	 unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -  100.00    102.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   96.00     90.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
